# Cloudflare Pages redirects — tsigalogo.gr
#
# ⚠️ These rules exist to make removed pages UNAVAILABLE, not to beautify URLs.
# Deleting a file from the deploy is NOT enough on Pages: unknown paths fall back
# to index.html (SPA behaviour) and edge caches keep old HTML for 7 days
# (s-maxage=604800) that a zone purge does not reliably clear. These 404 rules stop
# the SPA fallback; a zone-level redirect rule (see the deployment skill) stops the
# cached copies.
#
# Removed on the owner's request — the business/review card artwork must not be
# reachable anywhere on the internet. Match both the extensionless path and the
# .html form (Pages clean-URLs 308-redirects the latter to the former).
/business-card* /404.html 404
/business-card.html /404.html 404
/Katerina-Tsiga.vcf /404.html 404
/card-preview* /404.html 404
/card-render* /404.html 404

# Earlier removal (Sep 2026): the Google-review QR page and its assets.
/review-card* /404.html 404
/review-card.html /404.html 404
/assets/qr-review.png /404.html 404
